        "document_sha256": "a88d0cd9b8e3b02df1f3efd55a99d11fc5620d524b321ae00db73d7625a686b6"
      },
      "src_a5f0cd95acbc375bbea249d25858ec96500f3ba228fc767eb1ed029504a09cea": {
        "source_id": "src_a5f0cd95acbc375bbea249d25858ec96500f3ba228fc767eb1ed029504a09cea",
        "doc_id": "model",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 25,
        "text": "本次研究采用固定的无时间反馈的有向无环结构模型。\n",
        "sha256": "2fcd9556d628c3480b3b06ab778419a83caf3ab9474821bdc77ca4005c715a50",
        "document_sha256": "fc8f8ed2d2fc6f009341bd18e4f33090367511e72497a57bcd94374f6c4f835d"
      },
      "src_496f9dbec337438d89da16ceab844c785109bafc44539a2094df873b7873bf11": {
        "source_id": "src_496f9dbec337438d89da16ceab844c785109bafc44539a2094df873b7873bf11",
        "doc_id": "model",
        "start": 25,
        "end": 56,
        "text": "上述清单列出了本模型的全部直接因果关系，没有其他直接因果边。\n",
        "sha256": "08478b6f0abbbb95303f1617eb17ded657b05902e6de19ba4b896445aa5b7232",
        "document_sha256": "fc8f8ed2d2fc6f009341bd18e4f33090367511e72497a57bcd94374f6c4f835d"
      },
      "src_d82217953d4f287c8f5847b324328d013aa2ea7c200432a4716a33f0798899eb": {
        "source_id": "src_d82217953d4f287c8f5847b324328d013aa2ea7c200432a4716a33f0798899eb",
        "doc_id": "model",
        "start": 56,
        "end": 85,
        "text": "所有共同原因均已在变量清单中列出，不另有遗漏的共同原因。\n",
        "sha256": "6e8dad409c8c1caa34386349b407c5ca2db4b50c8a0a6aea7f6e29298f4b130b",
        "document_sha256": "fc8f8ed2d2fc6f009341bd18e4f33090367511e72497a57bcd94374f6c4f835d"
      },
      "src_5c181a83314b455fa5973ac42d409a177326bfe088537229fd998f5bbfad07f7": {
        "source_id": "src_5c181a83314b455fa5973ac42d409a177326bfe088537229fd998f5bbfad07f7",
        "doc_id": "model",
        "start": 85,
        "end": 104,
        "text": "各变量结构方程中的剩余噪声相互独立。\n",
        "sha256": "29c671f051151594afac6e87e03cc55d87b1e503e8ca5a01157085ae203c1201",
        "document_sha256": "fc8f8ed2d2fc6f009341bd18e4f33090367511e72497a57bcd94374f6c4f835d"
      },
      "src_7e6a14219f1e8b9852e95d8f53f2151b1a0ff84e576489800404cae927ae5009": {
        "source_id": "src_7e6a14219f1e8b9852e95d8f53f2151b1a0ff84e576489800404cae927ae5009",
        "doc_id": "model",
        "start": 104,
        "end": 131,
